  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667f583e6953646902940683-09fab1db.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot and zucchini into half-moons. Trim and roughly chop green beans. Cut Malaysian tofu into bite-sized chunks.\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook tofu, tossing occasionally, until golden brown, 2-4 mins. Cook in batches if your pan is getting crowded. Transfer to a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667f583e6953646902940683-9a0b3a39.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook zucchini, carrot and green beans, tossing, until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium then add Malaysian spice blend and ginger paste, and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in coconut milk, the soy sauce, vegetable stock powder and tofu and cook until slightly reduced, 1-2 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667f583e6953646902940683-34c0e28b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls.\n• Top with Malaysian tofu and green bean coconut curry and crushed peanuts.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-667f583e6953646902940683-6b9d5f0c.jpeg"
    }
  ]
